y the owner and nothing is blocked on him. F-1672-1's 150.8 MiB path-scoping ruling, F-1675-1's `rc=0 = STOP` freshness pre-condition and F-1676-1's worktree-side discriminator all stand **unchanged and unqualified** — this adds a leaf-flip condition downstream of all three, and changes none of them.
