# AP-16 final verbs preserve seeded hashes

AP-16-6 added the last buildable same-game door verbs to the headless contract sim:

- `SET_WEAPON {weapon:"rig"|"blast"}` is an idempotent mode setter. The view reports `now.weapon`; the corresponding automatic Spark Rig or Blast Charge shooter is enabled, while explicit `BLAST_AT` remains available for compatibility.
- `SECURE_CHOICE {choice:"bank"|"rush"}` exists only at a frozen secure boundary. Silence uses the difficulty offer clock and the boot default (`bank`, or `rush` under `--overtime`) and increments `defaultedSecure`.
- `CONTEXT_ACTION` routes upgrade and demolish through `BuildSystem` with `{id,index}` and funds a research-unlocked active megaproject at the Prospector position using the shared unlock, cost, and state helpers.

Explicit rush and silent `--overtime` on seed `ap16-6-rush` both hash to `fnv1a32:e8f80526`. Existing gr-sim pins remain unchanged; the additive outcome field is `defaultedSecure`.

The class-8 audit moved 66 rows from `agent-lacks` to `equal`: overall `agent-lacks 439 -> 373`, `equal 641 -> 707`. Four cited exemptions remain: post-death action, between-run research choice, pause pacing, and `skip_ceremony`. Headless Baron spawn bypasses ceremony directly at `src/sim/HeadlessContractSim.ts:486`.

Related: [[AP-16 Same-game audit is a derived parity matrix]], [[2026-08-10-ap16-4-same-game-admission]]

